II. Services
2.1 Service Content

The service content refer to the cross-platform communication tool (hereinafter referred to as "Weixin") provided by Tencent to the users, supporting single-person and multi-person participation and instant messaging services including transmission of voice SMS, video, pictures, emojis and text. It also provides users with, including but not limited to, connection expansion, convenient0 tools, Weixin Official Accounts, Open platforms, software licenses and services for functions or content such as information exchange with other software or hardware (hereinafter referred to as "the service").

2.2 Service Forms

2.2.1 You need to download the Tencent Weixin application to use the Services. Tencent will grant you a non-transferable and non-exclusive license for the Software. You can log in to Weixin for Web, Weixin for Windows, or Weixin for Mac via scanning the QR code. You may only use the Software and Services for the purpose of accessing to or using the Services.

2.2.2 Tencent may provide multiple versions of the Weixin application, including but not limited to iOS, Android, Windows Phone, Symbian, BlackBerry, Windows and Mac. Users are required to select the software version matching the installed terminal device.

2.3 Scope of Authorized Services

2.3.1 Tencent grants you a personal, non-transferable and non-exclusive license to use the Software. You may install, use, display and run the Software for non-commercial purposes on a single terminal device.

2.3.2 You may make a copy of the Software for the purpose of personal use of the Software and Services, and shall only use the copy as a backup. The copy must contain all the copyright information from the original Software.

2.3.3 All other rights not expressly authorized by this article and other terms of this Agreement are still reserved by Tencent. You must obtain Tencent's written permission when exercising these rights. Tencent's failure to exercise any of the foregoing rights does not constitute a waiver of such rights.

